     3049        t-doc.doc-date    at row 4 col 5  colon-aligned label "&Дата" view-as fill-in size 9 by 1 fgcolor 4
     3050        t-doc.fact-date   at row 4 col 20 colon-aligned label "&Факт" view-as fill-in size 9 by 1 fgcolor 4
