     4009   on leave of t-doc.agnt in frame d-out-doc  do:
     4010     if not available t-doc then return .
     4011     if input frame d-out-doc t-doc.agnt <> t-doc.agnt then do:
     4012       run local-psn-chk ("agnt", "leave").
     4013     end.
     4014   end.
     4015   on leave of t-doc.boss in frame d-out-doc   do:
