     8420   end.
     8421   on ctrl-f of t-doc.doc-date,t-doc.fact-date,t-doc.shift-date in frame d-out-doc
     8422   do:
     8423     if (can-query (self, "sensitive")
     8424        and
     8425        self :sensitive = true
     8426        )
     8427     or (can-query (self, "read-only")
     8428        and
